>Brodt</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Becker</surname><given-names>S</given-names></string-name>, <etal/> Identification of a novel coronavirus in patients with severe acute respiratory syndrome. N Engl J Med <year>2003</year>: May 15;348:1967&#x02013;76.</mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R6"><label>6. </label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><article-title>Global surveillance for severe acute respiratory syndrome.</article-title><source>Wkly Epidemiol Rec</source>. <year>2003</year>;<volume>78</volume>:<fpage>97</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>120</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12723281</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R7"><label>7. </label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>N</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Hui</surname><given-names>D</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>P</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Cameron</surname><given-names>P</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Joynt</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>A major outbreak of severe acute respiratory syndrome in Hong Kong.</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source>. <year>2003</year>;<volume>348</volume>:<fpage>1986</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>94</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1056/NEJMoa030685</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12682352</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R8"><label>8. </label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Hsu</surname><given-names>L-Y</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Le</surname><given-names>C-C</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Green</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Ang</surname><given-names>B</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Patton</surna